      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### PostgreSQL — Query telemetry (pg_stat_ch)\nOne event **per statement execution** from `platform-db` and `product-db`, shipped by the `pg_stat_ch` extension into ClickHouse `pg_stat_ch.events_raw` (7 days hot, 90 days total). This answers what `pg_stat_statements` cannot: **server-side p50/p95/p99 over time**, errors by SQLSTATE, per-app/role load, and *what changed between two moments*. `db_name` is the cluster key (every database name is unique across clusters). Statements shorter than the ring can hold under overload are **dropped, never queued** — check the exporter-health row before trusting a dip."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Overview — health at a glance",
      "collapsed": false,
